{"seq":33,"slug":"toyota","title":"丰田企业文化与管理哲学","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":29,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota","rating":{"composite":4.12,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":2.88,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 丰田企业文化与管理哲学 简介\n\n丰田汽车公司从织布机作坊起步，用不到一个世纪的时间成长为全球最大的汽车制造商之一。支撑这一奇迹的并非某项单一技术突破，而是一整套以\"持续改善\"和\"尊重人\"为双支柱的管理体系——即人们常说的\"丰田之道\"（Toyota Way）。\n\n本知识库从七个维度解剖丰田管理哲学的内核、组织运作与未来转型。\n\n**第一章 文化与价值观** 探讨丰田生产方式（TPS）的哲学根基、全员改善（Kaizen）文化如何在组织中扎根、\"尊重人\"原则怎样从口号变为日常行为，以及Toyota Way 14条原则的现代演变、丰田章男时代的文化转型、\"量产幸福\"使命愿景和ものづくり（造物精神）。\n\n**第二章 绩效体系** 剖析终身雇佣制与年功序列在现代丰田的演变形态、方针管理（Hoshin Kanri）如何实现战略到执行的对齐、以及A3报告和5 Why等工具构成的问题解决文化。\n\n**第三章 组织与人才** 分析丰田独特的知识传承机制、与供应商建立的长期共生伙伴关系、以及全球扩张中在集中控制与本地自治之间的平衡之道。\n\n**第四章 战略与方法论** 深入准时制（JIT）、自働化（Jidoka）与安灯系统、现地现物等方法论的实践逻辑，展现丰田如何将抽象原则转化为可操作的现场管理工具。\n\n**第五章 职级与薪酬** 解剖丰田从担当职到幹部职的完整等级架构、薪酬结构（基本给、奖金、福利）、绩效考核体系（目标管理+人事考课）和职场生存指南。\n\n**第六章 岗位与职业路线** 覆盖软件工程师（Arene OS/自动驾驶/智能工厂/Connected四大方向）、制造/生产技术工程师、研发工程师、商品企划和全球运营五大职业发展路径。\n\n**第七章 AI与数字化转型** 聚焦Woven City智慧城市实验室、自动驾驶战略（Physical AI/Aurora/Robotaxi）、AI在制造中的应用（视觉检测/预测维护/数字孪生）和AI转型中涌现的新职业机遇。\n\n本知识库适合对精益管理感兴趣的管理者、运营从业者、组织研究者，以及希望理解日本制造业管理范式的读者。也适合考虑进入丰田或日资车企的求职者。建议从第一章开始顺序阅读，先理解价值观基础，再进入制度与工具层面，最后关注AI转型方向。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"toyota-production-system","title":"丰田精益生产 TPS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/toyota-production-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kaizen-culture","title":"丰田改善(Kaizen)文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/kaizen-culture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"respect-for-people","title":"丰田\"尊重人\"原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/respect-for-people"},{"seq":4,"slug":"toyota-way-philosophy","title":"丰田之道（Toyota Way）完整解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/toyota-way-philosophy"},{"seq":5,"slug":"mission-vision-values","title":"丰田使命愿景价值观：从\"造车\"到\"量产幸福\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/mission-vision-values"},{"seq":6,"slug":"akio-toyoda-transformation","title":"丰田章男的改革：从汽车公司到移动出行公司","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/akio-toyoda-transformation"},{"seq":7,"slug":"monozukuri-craftmanship","title":"ものづくり（制造精神）：日本匠人文化在现代制造的延续","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/monozukuri-craftmanship"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"绩效体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lifetime-employment","title":"丰田终身雇佣与年功序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/performance-system/lifetime-employment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hoshin-kanri","title":"丰田方针管理(Hoshin Kanri)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/performance-system/hoshin-kanri"},{"seq":3,"slug":"problem-solving-culture","title":"丰田问题解决文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/performance-system/problem-solving-culture"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tps-knowledge-transfer","title":"丰田生产方式的知识传承","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/org-and-talent/tps-knowledge-transfer"},{"seq":2,"slug":"supplier-partnership","title":"丰田供应商伙伴关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/org-and-talent/supplier-partnership"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-local-balance","title":"丰田全球化与本地化平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/toyota/org-and-talent/global-local-balance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodology","title":"战略与方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-